[indent]•  [color=#000000]演义系[/color]：嘉靖/重刻京本（NA12090）、毛宗岗本（NA11031）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]志传系[/color]：周曰校本（NA11011，万历1591）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


